#X text 240 138 Therefore \, you need to use a level converter from
5V to 3.3V \, otherwise you can damage the Raspberry Pi!;
#X text 240 178 When created \, the object takes exclusive ownership
of the GPIO pins @trig_pin and @echo_pin - it is *impossible* to use
them in other objects simultaneously with this one.;
